Output target/demo/card.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 30
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set Padding 24
Hide
Type "PS1=''; clear; printf '\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                      \033[38;5;173m… about 5 minutes later …\033[0m'; tput civis"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 300ms
Screenshot target/demo/card.png
